{"name":"Riverdale","hex":"#bec5ba","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Riverdale","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A neighbourhood of Edmonton, Alberta, Canada.","A neighbourhood of the Rural Municipality of West St. Paul, Manitoba, Canada."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Riverdale"}],"entries":[{"title":"Lewisham Shopping Centre","blocks":[{"text":"Lewisham Shopping Centre, formerly Riverdale Centre, is a shopping mall located in Lewisham, London, England. The centre is the major shopping centre in the London Borough of Lewisham. Also part of the complex is the Lewisham House office tower, formerly occupied by Citibank. There are proposals to convert this building to flats."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Lewisham_Shopping_Centre_1.jpg/330px-Lewisham_Shopping_Centre_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lewisham_Shopping_Centre"},{"title":"Riverdale House","blocks":[{"text":"Riverdale House is a Victorian mansion located at 89 Graham Road in the Ranmoor area of Sheffield, England. Formerly a private residence, the building, which is Grade II Listed has now been adopted for commercial use and accommodates several small businesses."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Riverdale_House_2%2C_Sheffield.jpg/330px-Riverdale_House_2%2C_Sheffield.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riverdale_House"},{"title":"Riverdale (American TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Riverdale is an American television series based on the characters of Archie Comics. The series was adapted for the CW Network by Archie Comics' chief creative officer Roberto Aguirre-Sacasa. It is produced by Warner Bros. Television and CBS Studios, in association with Berlanti Productions and Archie Comics."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/9/98/Riverdale.png/330px-Riverdale.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riverdale_(American_TV_series)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Lewisham_Shopping_Centre_3.jpg/500px-Lewisham_Shopping_Centre_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Lewisham_Shopping_Centre_3.jpg/1280px-Lewisham_Shopping_Centre_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Lewisham_Shopping_Centre_3.jpg/500px-Lewisham_Shopping_Centre_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Interior","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALewisham_Shopping_Centre_3.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Riverdale_House_Lodge.jpg/500px-Riverdale_House_Lodge.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Riverdale_House_Lodge.jpg/1280px-Riverdale_House_Lodge.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/90/Riverdale_House_Lodge.jpg/500px-Riverdale_House_Lodge.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The lodge.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARiverdale_House_Lodge.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Riverdale_panel_at_SDCC_2017_%2836174502760%29.jpg/500px-Riverdale_panel_at_SDCC_2017_%2836174502760%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/Riverdale_panel_at_SDCC_2017_%2836174502760%29.jpg/1280px-Riverdale_panel_at_SDCC_2017_%2836174502760